{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.vitalvoices.org/Programs VV Visionaries in Partnership with the Estée Lauder Emerging Leaders Fund.txt"},"lines":{"text":"Faith Siele is planning to launch Sifa to Birika Women (SBW), an initiative dedicated to empowering women in the Maa community of Namanga in Southern Kenya. The organization's mission is to provide these women with dragon fruit, aloe vera seedlings, and the essential tools and knowledge to sustainably cultivate these valuable crops.\n"},"line_number":2183,"absolute_offset":191742,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"fruit"},"start":222,"end":227}]}}
